<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Responsive Flexbox menu bar for BCA Artificial Intelligence portfolio.">
  <title>Pranav AI - Flexbox Menu Bar</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fa;
      color: #222;
    }
    .menu {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: #1d3557;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .menu__brand {
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      padding: 1rem 0;
    }
    .menu__list {
      display: flex;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .menu__list a {
      display: block;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .menu__list a:hover,
    .menu__list a.active {
      background: #457b9d;
    }
    .menu__cta {
      margin-left: 1rem;
      background: #e63946;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .menu__cta:hover {
      background: #c92f3b;
    }
    /* Responsive: stack menu on small screens */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .menu {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .menu__brand {
        text-align: center;
      }
      .menu__list {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .menu__cta {
        margin: 0.5rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
    main {
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    main h1 {
      color: #1d3557;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    main p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="menu" aria-label="Main Navigation">
    <div class="menu__brand">Pranav AI</div>
    <ul class="menu__list">
      <li><a class="active" href="#">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Projects</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a class="menu__cta" href="#">Sign Up</a>
  </nav>
  <main>
    <h1>Flexbox Menu Bar</h1>
    <p>
      This page demonstrates how CSS Flexbox can be used
      to create a responsive navigation menu. Resize the
      browser window to see the menu stack on smaller screens.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
